ม -> Phrom, \"ห is silent\"). ห + ว is pronunciation-dependent (note 4: หวอ -> wo but หวย -> huai) and stays in the lexicon layer.\n\n    Carrier-interleaved compound vowels (เ-C-า khao) are encoded through the digraph rows above; adjacent-sign compounds (ก-ล-ั-ว klua, ม-ื-อ mue, เ-า ao) are encoded as adjacent-sign rows.\""},"stages":[{"kind":"stage","name":"main","rules":[{"kind":"parallel","rules":[{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"่"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"้"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"๊"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"๋"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"็"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"ก์"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"ข์"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"ค์"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"ง์"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"จ์"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"ช์"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"ญ์"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"ด์"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"ต์"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"ถ์"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"ท์"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"น์"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"string","value":"บ์"},"to":{"kind":"string","value":""}},{"kind":"sub","from":{"kind":"stri